  "notes": "Verified modern scholarly article published in Journal of Cuneiform Studies 62(1) in 2010, pages 53-69. It is the direct established control for interpreting Sumerian literary extract tablets in relation to progressive learning, memorization, tablet form, composition segments, and diagnostic errors. The Work is not an ancient extract-tablet Collection, physical artifact, universal Type III class, curriculum entity, school institution, passage, composition state, or proof of copying from memory. The 2023 ISAC return and Delnero's 2024 chapter are distinct contained Works supplying object-visible and corpus-relative controls. Only bibliographic identity and an unreviewed source-reported authorship claim are admitted; no article payload, Expression, Edition, Item, artifact, image, text, transliteration, translation, pedagogical claim, semantic claim, graph relation, or canon state is created.",
